{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1220","id":3983683648,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87tcjBA","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1220","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1220.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1220.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1220","number":1220,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Expand Paper Map topic mocks","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis PR expands the Paper Workspace mock surface so the Paper Map is not limited to the Integration Techniques chapter. The Paper Map now exposes all eight Pure Mathematics 3 chapter cards as clickable topic routes, and Topic Detail renders topic-specific mock method-map content based on the route parameter.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe previous mock flow only treated `Integration Techniques` as a real topic workspace. Other Paper Map chapter cards either had no route or could not render a chapter-specific Method Map. That made the workspace feel thinner than the V1 product map and blocked review of the intended chapter navigation behavior.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe topic detail route was hard-coded to `/workspace/9709/p3/topics/integration-techniques`, and the Topic Detail page carried hard-coded Integration methods and question types. The overview only linked the active Integration topic, while `Unseen` chapters with no review tasks or artifacts were normalized into a locked visual state that disabled links.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Converts the Paper Workspace topic route to `/workspace/9709/p3/topics/:topicId` while preserving the canonical Integration route constant.\n- Adds route helpers for P3 topic slugs and Paper Map click targets.\n- Adds lightweight mock profiles for the eight P3 chapters, including method-map methods, representative question types, trigger cues, and fixed procedures.\n- Makes every Paper Map topic card route to its chapter workspace.\n- Reads `topicId` in Topic Detail and renders topic-specific methods and question types.\n- Keeps `Unseen` mock chapters clickable by giving them an explicit inactive card state rather than the locked state.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm.cmd test -- src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/paper-workspace-model.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/paper-workspace-pr2-core-pages.test.js --runInBand`\n- `npm.cmd run build`\n- Browser-verified `http://127.0.0.1:5175/workspace/9709/p3` exposes eight topic links.\n- Browser-verified `/workspace/9709/p3/topics/numerical-methods` renders `Trapezium Rule Estimate`.\n- Browser-verified `/workspace/9709/p3/topics/vectors` renders `Vector Parameter Check`.\n\n## Notes\n\nUnrelated local changes remain uncommitted in the working tree: `.gitignore`, `package.json`, `.npmrc`, `.tools/`, and `artifacts/frontend-v1-audit/`.\r\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T05:58:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T06:00:51Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T05:58:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T05:58:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"d9f26b8fc411d7bbae